{"seq":4,"slug":"batch-vs-realtime","title":"批量与实时推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/serving-and-inference/batch-vs-realtime","wordCount":1607,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"批量与实时推理\">批量与实时推理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ML 推理服务按时效性要求分为两种基本范式：实时推理（Real-Time Inference）和批量推理（Batch Inference）。实时推理在请求到达时立即处理并返回结果，延迟通常要求在毫秒到秒级；批量推理对大量数据进行离线处理，关注的是吞吐量而非单请求延迟。两种范式在架构设计、资源规划和成本模型上有本质差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;实时推理&quot;&#10;        A1[用户请求] --&gt; B1[模型服务]&#10;        B1 --&gt; C1[即时响应]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;批量推理&quot;&#10;        A2[数据批次] --&gt; B2[批处理引擎]&#10;        B2 --&gt; C2[结果存储]&#10;        C2 --&gt; D2[下游消费]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"实时推理\"\n        A1[用户请求] --&gt; B1[模型服务]\n        B1 --&gt; C1[即时响应]\n    end\n    subgraph \"批量推理\"\n        A2[数据批次] --&gt; B2[批处理引擎]\n        B2 --&gt; C2[结果存储]\n        C2 --&gt; D2[下游消费]\n    end</pre><p>选择推理范式需要综合考虑业务需求、延迟要求和成本预算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>实时推理</th>\n<th>批量推理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟要求</td>\n<td>毫秒-秒级</td>\n<td>分钟-小时级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>受延迟 SLA 限制</td>\n<td>最大化吞吐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源利用</td>\n<td>需要常驻实例</td>\n<td>按需启动，完成后释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本模型</td>\n<td>按实例时间计费</td>\n<td>按处理量计费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>搜索推荐、对话、实时风控</td>\n<td>报表生成、数据标注、特征计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错要求</td>\n<td>快速失败 + 降级</td>\n<td>重试 + 断点续跑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实时推理架构设计\">实时推理架构设计</h2><p>实时推理的核心挑战是在严格的延迟 SLA（如 P99 &lt; 100ms）下最大化吞吐量。这需要从请求处理流程的每个环节进行优化：请求解析、特征获取、模型推理和结果后处理。</p>\n<p>动态批处理（Dynamic Batching）是提升实时推理吞吐量的关键技术。当多个请求在短时间内到达时，将它们组装为一个 batch 一次性送入模型推理，batch 内的请求共享 GPU 计算资源。batch 大小需要在吞吐量和延迟之间权衡——batch 越大吞吐量越高，但等待凑 batch 的时间也越长。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import asyncio&#10;from collections import deque&#10;&#10;class DynamicBatcher:&#10;    def __init__(self, model, max_batch_size=32, max_wait_ms=10):&#10;        self.model = model&#10;        self.max_batch_size = max_batch_size&#10;        self.max_wait_ms = max_wait_ms&#10;        self.queue = deque()&#10;        self.running = True&#10;&#10;    async def predict(self, input_data):&#10;        future = asyncio.get_event_loop().create_future()&#10;        self.queue.append((input_data, future))&#10;        return await future&#10;&#10;    async def batch_loop(self):&#10;        while self.running:&#10;            if not self.queue:&#10;                await asyncio.sleep(0.001)&#10;                continue&#10;&#10;            batch_inputs = []&#10;            batch_futures = []&#10;&#10;            deadline = asyncio.get_event_loop().time() + self.max_wait_ms / 1000&#10;&#10;            while len(batch_inputs) &lt; self.max_batch_size:&#10;                if not self.queue:&#10;                    remaining = deadline - asyncio.get_event_loop().time()&#10;                    if remaining &lt;= 0:&#10;                        break&#10;                    await asyncio.sleep(min(remaining, 0.001))&#10;                    continue&#10;                inp, fut = self.queue.popleft()&#10;                batch_inputs.append(inp)&#10;                batch_futures.append(fut)&#10;&#10;            if batch_inputs:&#10;                results = self.model.batch_predict(batch_inputs)&#10;                for fut, result in zip(batch_futures, results):&#10;                    fut.set_result(result)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> collections </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deque</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DynamicBatcher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model, max_batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, max_wait_ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.max_batch_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_batch_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.max_wait_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_wait_ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.queue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deque()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.running </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> predict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, input_data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        future </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.get_event_loop().create_future()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.queue.append((input_data, future))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> future</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> batch_loop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        while</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.running:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.queue:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            batch_inputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            batch_futures </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            deadline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.get_event_loop().time() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.max_wait_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            while</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batch_inputs) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.max_batch_size:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.queue:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deadline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.get_event_loop().time()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                        break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(remaining, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                inp, fut </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.queue.popleft()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                batch_inputs.append(inp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                batch_futures.append(fut)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_inputs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model.batch_predict(batch_inputs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fut, result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batch_futures, results):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    fut.set_result(result)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>请求优先级管理是实时推理的进阶优化。不同来源或不同用户等级的请求可以设置不同的优先级，高优先级请求跳过普通队列优先处理。这在付费用户和免费用户共享推理资源的场景中尤为重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[请求队列] --&gt; B[动态批处理器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[GPU 推理]&#10;    C --&gt; D[结果分发]&#10;    A --&gt; E[优先级排序]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    F[超时检测] --&gt; B\">graph LR\n    A[请求队列] --&gt; B[动态批处理器]\n    B --&gt; C[GPU 推理]\n    C --&gt; D[结果分发]\n    A --&gt; E[优先级排序]\n    E --&gt; B\n    F[超时检测] --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"批量推理架构设计\">批量推理架构设计</h2><p>批量推理的核心目标是在给定的计算预算和时间窗口内处理尽可能多的数据。与实时推理不同，批量推理可以充分利用大 batch size、数据预排序和资源动态分配等策略来最大化 GPU 利用率。</p>\n<p>大 batch size 是批量推理效率的关键。不受延迟约束时，可以将 batch size 提升到 GPU 显存允许的最大值，使每个 GPU 周期处理更多样本。对于变长输入（如 NLP 文本），按长度分桶（Bucketing）——将相似长度的输入组成一个 batch——可以显著减少 Padding 浪费。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;from torch.utils.data import DataLoader&#10;&#10;class BatchInferencePipeline:&#10;    def __init__(self, model, batch_size=256, num_workers=4):&#10;        self.model = model.eval()&#10;        self.batch_size = batch_size&#10;        self.num_workers = num_workers&#10;&#10;    def run(self, dataset, output_path):&#10;        dataloader = DataLoader(&#10;            dataset,&#10;            batch_size=self.batch_size,&#10;            num_workers=self.num_workers,&#10;            pin_memory=True,&#10;            collate_fn=self.bucket_collate,&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        all_results = []&#10;        with torch.no_grad(), torch.cuda.amp.autocast():&#10;            for batch in dataloader:&#10;                batch = {k: v.cuda(non_blocking=True) for k, v in batch.items()}&#10;                outputs = self.model(**batch)&#10;                all_results.extend(outputs.cpu().tolist())&#10;&#10;        self.save_results(all_results, output_path)&#10;&#10;    def bucket_collate(self, samples):&#10;        samples.sort(key=lambda x: len(x[&quot;input_ids&quot;]), reverse=True)&#10;        return default_collate(samples)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.utils.data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DataLoader</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BatchInferencePipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model, batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_workers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.eval()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.batch_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.num_workers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_workers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, dataset, output_path):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dataloader </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DataLoader(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            dataset,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.batch_size,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            num_workers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.num_workers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            pin_memory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            collate_fn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bucket_collate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        all_results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad(), torch.cuda.amp.autocast():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataloader:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {k: v.cuda(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">non_blocking</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k, v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch.items()}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                outputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                all_results.extend(outputs.cpu().tolist())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.save_results(all_results, output_path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bucket_collate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, samples):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        samples.sort(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input_ids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> default_collate(samples)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Spark ML 和 Ray Data 是大规模批量推理的分布式框架。Spark ML 适合与现有 Spark 数据管道集成的场景，Ray Data 提供了更灵活的 GPU 调度能力。两者都支持数据分区并行推理、结果自动聚合和容错重试。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>GPU 支持</th>\n<th>数据格式</th>\n<th>生态集成</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PyTorch DataLoader</td>\n<td>单机</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>内存/文件</td>\n<td>PyTorch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ray Data</td>\n<td>分布式</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>多种</td>\n<td>Ray 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spark ML</td>\n<td>大规模分布式</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>DataFrame</td>\n<td>Spark/Hadoop</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Triton Batch</td>\n<td>单机多 GPU</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>gRPC/HTTP</td>\n<td>Triton</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"混合推理架构\">混合推理架构</h2><p>实际业务中，同一个模型往往同时需要实时和批量两种推理能力。例如，推荐系统需要实时推理为当前请求生成推荐结果，同时需要批量推理为全量用户预计算候选集。</p>\n<p>混合架构的核心设计是资源隔离与共享的平衡。实时推理和批量推理使用不同的 GPU 资源池，避免批量任务抢占实时任务的 GPU 导致延迟飙升。但在实时流量低谷时，批量任务可以临时使用空闲的实时推理 GPU，提高整体资源利用率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[模型仓库] --&gt; B[实时推理池]&#10;    A --&gt; C[批量推理池]&#10;    B --&gt; D[在线请求]&#10;    C --&gt; E[离线任务]&#10;    F[资源调度器] --&gt; B&#10;    F --&gt; C&#10;    G[流量监控] --&gt; F\">graph TB\n    A[模型仓库] --&gt; B[实时推理池]\n    A --&gt; C[批量推理池]\n    B --&gt; D[在线请求]\n    C --&gt; E[离线任务]\n    F[资源调度器] --&gt; B\n    F --&gt; C\n    G[流量监控] --&gt; F</pre><p>Lambda Architecture 是一种经典的混合架构模式。批处理层（Batch Layer）定期对全量数据运行批量推理，生成基础预测结果存入结果库。速度层（Speed Layer）对增量数据运行实时推理，生成最新的预测更新。服务层（Serving Layer）合并批处理结果和实时更新，提供最终的查询服务。这种架构既保证了全量数据的处理完整性，又提供了最新数据的实时性。</p>\n<p>预计算与实时推理的混合策略在推荐系统中尤为常见。离线批量推理预先为每个用户计算候选集（如 top-1000 候选商品），存入 Redis 等高速缓存。实时推理在用户请求到来时，从缓存读取候选集，结合用户实时行为特征进行精排，返回最终推荐结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本与性能权衡\">成本与性能权衡</h2><p>不同推理范式的成本结构差异显著。实时推理需要常驻 GPU 实例以保证低延迟响应，即使在低流量时段也需要维持一定的实例数；批量推理可以使用竞价实例（Spot Instances）大幅降低成本，因为任务可以容忍中断和重试。</p>\n<p>推理成本优化的核心策略包括：模型量化降低每次推理的计算成本、动态批处理提升 GPU 利用率、自动扩缩容匹配流量波动、竞价实例用于批量任务和非关键的实时任务。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>成本降低</th>\n<th>适用范式</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>INT8 量化</td>\n<td>40-60%</td>\n<td>两种</td>\n<td>精度微降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态批处理</td>\n<td>30-50%</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>延迟微增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞价实例</td>\n<td>60-80%</td>\n<td>批量</td>\n<td>可能中断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动扩缩容</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>冷启动延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型蒸馏</td>\n<td>50-70%</td>\n<td>两种</td>\n<td>开发成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((批量与实时推理))&#10;    实时推理&#10;      动态批处理&#10;      优先级队列&#10;      延迟 SLA&#10;    批量推理&#10;      大 Batch Size&#10;      分桶策略&#10;      分布式框架&#10;    混合架构&#10;      Lambda Architecture&#10;      预计算+精排&#10;      资源隔离共享&#10;    成本优化&#10;      量化&#10;      竞价实例&#10;      扩缩容\">mindmap\n  root((批量与实时推理))\n    实时推理\n      动态批处理\n      优先级队列\n      延迟 SLA\n    批量推理\n      大 Batch Size\n      分桶策略\n      分布式框架\n    混合架构\n      Lambda Architecture\n      预计算+精排\n      资源隔离共享\n    成本优化\n      量化\n      竞价实例\n      扩缩容</pre><ul>\n<li>实时推理和批量推理是两种本质不同的推理范式，在延迟、吞吐和成本上各有优势</li>\n<li>动态批处理是实时推理提升吞吐量的核心技术，分桶策略是批量推理减少浪费的关键</li>\n<li>混合架构结合两种范式的优势，Lambda Architecture 是经典的混合设计模式</li>\n<li>成本优化需要综合运用量化、批处理、扩缩容和竞价实例等多种策略</li>\n<li>选择推理范式的核心依据是业务的延迟要求和数据处理模式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"批量与实时推理","id":"批量与实时推理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实时推理架构设计","id":"实时推理架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"批量推理架构设计","id":"批量推理架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"混合推理架构","id":"混合推理架构"},{"level":2,"text":"成本与性能权衡","id":"成本与性能权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"边缘推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/serving-and-inference/edge-inference"},"next":{"title":"Harness 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/harness-and-orchestration/harness-architecture"}}